WEBVTT

00:00:00.393 --> 00:00:03.224
How to <b>find a product</b> in seconds

00:00:03.376 --> 00:00:08.766
Type the way you do at the counter: no accents still finds the ones that <b>do</b> have them

00:00:08.906 --> 00:00:14.034
And if you miss a letter, it still finds it

00:00:14.176 --> 00:00:19.804
The <b>barcode</b> works too: the scanner types it here and the product shows up

00:00:19.937 --> 00:00:23.817
Or browse by <b>category</b>

00:00:23.934 --> 00:00:28.525
With <b>photo view</b>, you recognize them at a glance
